meta {
  name: Get All Chat History
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/chat/:chat_type
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  chat_type: ai
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Chat History

  This request is used to get all ai chat history when user use the App. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and has a pagination.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name      | Type   | Required | Description                      | Example |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------|---------|
  | chat_type | string | yes      | Chat Type can be `ai` or `nlp`   | ai      |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Chat fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "chat fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "question": "Hello there!",
          "answer": "Lorem ipsum",
          "is_success": 1,
          "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — chat failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "chat not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}